<article>
<h1><span class="emoji">🚀</span> Rocket</h1>
<section class="description">
<h2>Emoji Meaning</h2>
<p>A rocket being propelled into <a href="https://emojipedia.org/milky-way/" title="🌌 Milky Way">space</a>. Sometimes used to indicate a fast increase, for instance when referring to stocks going&nbsp;<em>to the moon&nbsp;</em>🚀 (rising quickly in price).</p>
<p>
<em>Rocket</em> was approved as part of <a href="https://emojipedia.org/unicode-6.0/">Unicode 6.0</a> in 2010
and added to <a href="https://emojipedia.org/emoji-1.0/">Emoji 1.0</a> in 2015.
</p>
<h2>Copy and Paste</h2>
<form class="stacked no-top copy-paste">
<label>
<span class="copy-paste__label">Copy and paste this emoji:</span>
<input type="text" value="🚀" readonly="" class="emoji-copy copy-paste__data" id="emoji-copy">
<button type="button" class="btn-clipboard copy-paste__btn" data-clipboard-target="#emoji-copy" style="width:auto;display:inline-block">Copy</button>
</label>
</form>
</section>
<section class="aliases">
<h2>Also Known As</h2>
<ul>
<li><span class="emoji">🚀</span> Rocket Ship</li>
<li><span class="emoji">🚀</span> Space Shuttle</li>
</ul>
</section>
